{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1773665924_6114482_e95afefc994d5faeba8f348716c24cc7.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">Our Mission:</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">At<strong> HUE</strong>TAPE, our mission is to provide high-quality skin tone kinesiology tape and other skin tone products to support and celebrate the unique needs of melanated individuals.  We currently offer our tape in three beautiful shades: Caramel, Walnut, and Espresso, with an Almond shade launching in the coming months. Our goal is to empower individuals to heal in peace, using products that match their unique skin tones.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';min-height:15px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">Why Choose<strong> HUE</strong>TAPE?</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">What sets us apart from other brands is our commitment to inclusivity and representation. Our tape not only helps relieve pain, soreness, and inflammation in muscles, joints, and ligaments, but it also blends seamlessly with your skin, allowing you to wear it confidently. Whether you are dealing with knee pain, back pain, or shoulder pain, our skin tone kinesiology tape can provide relief while maintaining a natural look.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';min-height:15px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">Affiliate Earnings:</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">As an affiliate, you will earn 12% on each order made through your custom affiliate link. This is a fantastic opportunity to share a product you believe in while generating income!</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';min-height:15px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">How to Promote Us:</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">1. Share Your Story: Be honest about your experience with our skin tone kinesiology tape. Talk about how you have used it, whether for a specific injury or for general support.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">2. Create Engaging Content: Share video footage showcasing your journey before and after using our product. Highlight how our tape matches your skin tone and how it has made a difference in your healing process.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">3. Emphasize the Emotional Connection: Discuss the confidence and comfort that comes with using a product designed for your skin tone. Share how it feels to wear tape that blends with your natural appearance.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">4. Showcase Quality Images: Ensure that the images you share are of high quality, showcasing our products in the best light. This not only attracts attention but also demonstrates the quality of what we offer.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">5. Educate on Product Usage: Inform your audience that our tape can be worn for up to 3 to 4 days, even while showering! Just remember to pat it dry gently after use. If you notice any unraveling or lifting at the corners, simply trim that area and continue wearing it.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';min-height:15px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">We believe that together, we can spread the message about the importance of representation in health and wellness products. Join us in this mission and let’s make a positive impact on our community!</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';min-height:15px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">Thank you for considering being a part of the<strong> HUE</strong>TAPE affiliate program. </p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';\">We look forward to partnering with you!</p></div>",
